"A study aid is an Artonan earring: a thin flat spiral of mauve clay with a faintly glowing tip."
"The maker whispers a spell to make it the owner's, then it is pierced through the earlobe."
"It sharpens focus on written and spoken words and general attentiveness."
"It lasts a season, and the piercing vanishes afterward."
"By custom a host inspects a gift offered to their guest before it is given."
